\f1\i0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f0\fs22 The ceremony was meant to conclude with something the program called an Evolutionary Baptism right there in the spa bath, but no one had checked whether the plumbing still worked. It didn\'92t. What dribbled from the tap was lees like water and more like dried Pepsi syrup. The Elvi took the setback as a sign, and instead baptised the newly sworn in High Elvis with a jug of Pepsi instead.\
