\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?Betty Lee,\u8221 ? said Kathy. \u8220 ?Her hair\u8217 ?s gone back to the colour it was. Not dyed back. Gone back, at the roots, on its own. Marguerita\u8217 ?s been telling me about that knee since [ ] and last week she did the splits at a party and hasn\u8217 ?t shut up about it. Dianne Carter over there was on that plaza and has been to more funerals than I have and she has the arms of a girl.\u8221 ? She let that sit. \u8220 ?And you. You were a mess when they brought you in and you have got steadily better ever since, in a way that nobody in this room has once remarked on, including you.\u8221 ?\
