\f0\i0\fs22 \cf2 \u8220 ?Chanta, I have been doctor to you people for a long time. I know what\u8217 ?s in an Elvis before I put a hand on one. The heart goes in the forties. The gut doesn\u8217 ?t work and never has. The knees, the pressure, the eyes. Half my practice is telling an Elvis in his prime that he is not going to see fifty, and the other half is burying the ones who didn\u8217 ?t believe me.\u8221 ? She gestured at the room with the flat of her hand, at the whole crowded shabby length of it. \u8220 ?Look at this lot. There isn\u8217 ?t a bad knee in that group by the curtains. Nobody is holding a table to stand up. Nobody is out of breath and every single one of them was on that plaza when the ones we buried on Thursday were standing next to them.\u8221 ?\
